se podtlak koji podiže razinu otopine do vrha birete.</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">3. Nakon što se bireta napunila, otpusti se odušak i bireta se automatski podesi na nulu.</p>\n"},"subContentId":"15552718-8cc3-4cc7-8644-0efe960a41cf","metadata":{"contentType":"Text","license":"U","title":"Untitled Text","authors":[],"changes":[]}},"pause":false,"displayType":"poster","buttonOnMobile":false,"visuals":{"backgroundColor":"rgba(255, 217, 102, 0.779)","boxShadow":true},"goto":{"url":{"protocol":"http://"},"visualize":false,"type":""},"label":""},{"x":3.2751091703057,"y":25.193798449612,"width":19.213973799127,"height":6.5502183406114,"duration":{"from":262,"to":272},"libraryTitle":"Text","action":{"library":"H5P.Text 1.1","params":{"text":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Potrebno je uočiti trenutak kada jedna kap dovodi do promjene obojenja u postojanu blago ljubičastu boju.</p>\n"},"subContentId":"7b897382-a033-4167-a1a2-512d4466da43","metadata":{"contentType":"Text","license":"U","title":"Untitled Text","authors":[],"changes":[]}},"pause":false,"displayType":"poster","buttonOnMobile":false,"visuals":{"backgroundColor":"rgba(255, 217, 102, 0.727)","boxShadow":true},"goto":{"url":{"protocol":"http://"},"visualize":false,"type":""},"label":""},{"x":2.1834061135371,"y":17.441860465116,"width":21.397379912664,"height":16.593886462882,"duration":{"from":298,"to":298},"libraryTitle":"Text","action":{"library":"H5P.Text 1.1","params":{"text":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Potrebno je:</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">1. Očitati utrošeni volumen NaOH (jedna crtica na bireti = 0,05 mL).</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">2. Zapisati faktor korekcije (<em>f </em>), koji je naveden na bireti.</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">3. Provjeriti dobiveni rezultat s voditeljem laboratorijskih vježbi.</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Pritisnite ▶ za nastavak vježbe.</p>\n"},"subContentId":"653903ed-4742-4c59-ae2e-1358bfabfd4b","metadata":{"contentType":"Text","license":"U","title":"Untitled Text","authors":[],"changes":[]}},"pause":true,"displayType":"poster","buttonOnMobile":false,"visuals":{"backgroundColor":"rgba(255, 217, 102, 0.779)","boxShadow":true},"goto":{"url":{"protocol":"http://"},"visualize":false,"type":""},"label":""},{"x":18.558951965066,"y":9.6899224806202,"width":23.580786026201,"height":4.8034934497817,"duration":{"from":305,"to":315},"libraryTitle":"Text","action":{"library":"H5P.Text 1.1","params":{"text":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Na početku drugog dijela vježbe, potrebno je izvagati približno 1 g kalijeva nitrata.</p>\n"},"subContentId":"dafdd3f0-0dc9-4e2b-9f63-c6219133359f","metadata":{"contentType":"Text","license":"U","title":"Untitled Text","authors":[],"changes":[]}},"pause":false,"displayType":"poster","buttonOnMobile":false,"visuals":{"backgroundColor":"rgba(255, 217, 102, 0.797)","boxShadow":true},"goto":{"url":{"protocol":"http://"},"visualize":false,"type":""},"label":""},{"x":2.1834061135371,"y":48.449612403101,"width":26.637554585153,"height":9.6069868995633,"duration":{"from":347,"to":357},"libraryTitle":"Text","action":{"library":"H5P.Text 1.1","params":{"text":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Ponovno se odmjeri 100 mL destilirane vode te se ulije u kalorimetar.</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Kalorimetar se potom zatvori i uz miješanje kruženjem po podlozi svakih 30 sekundi očitava se temperatura do ustaljenja.</p>\n"},"subContentId":"8b75b996-3a86-4b7a-98f9-846168782ee1","metadata":{"contentType":"Text","license":"U","title":"Untitled Text","authors":[],"changes":[]}},"pause":false,"displayType":"poster","buttonOnMobile":false,"visuals":{"backgroundColor":"rgba(255, 217, 102, 0.791)","boxShadow":true},"goto":{"url":{"protocol":"http://"},"visualize":false,"type":""},"label":""},{"x":44.759825327511,"y":9.6899224806202,"width":20.524017467249,"height":17.903930131004,"duration":{"from":362,"to":373},"libraryTitle":"Text","action":{"library":"H5P.Text 1.1",